# Typography: logo/brand font site-wide

This campaign site uses **one primary font family** for a consistent, professional look.

## Rules

- Default all UI/body typography to the **logo/brand font** (currently Montserrat).
- Avoid introducing additional fonts (no new `next/font` imports, no ad-hoc font stacks).
- Use weights and casing (e.g. `font-black`, uppercase headings) for hierarchy instead of switching typefaces.

